{"id": "bart-financial-advisory-administration-cost", "title": "BART paid an avoidable $56,000 fee for financial advice under an engineering contract", "seconds": 43.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "ae7f341293a5a8d0", "words": 107, "beats": [{"scene": "contract", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "During the pandemic fiscal crisis, BART needed financial advice.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.27, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "ordered", "the", "financial", "advice?"], "sub": "BART procurement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.36, 0.92, 1.36, 2.18, 2.56, 2.88, 3.44]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The district obtained the work through an engineering prime contractor.", "t0": 4.39, "t1": 7.94, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "BART Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Engineering contracts", "mark": "Engineering contracts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.59, 0.99, 1.08, 1.34, 1.55, 1.69, 2.32, 2.68]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Inspector General examined 1.6 million dollars in financial advisory workplans.", "t0": 8.06, "t1": 13.7, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.6 million", "label": "Financial advisory workplans"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.66, 1.07, 1.63, 1.88, 2.25, 2.61, 3.02, 3.47, 3.6, 4.12, 4.75]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "BART paid the engineering prime 56,000 dollars to administer them.", "t0": 13.82, "t1": 18.33, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Engineering prime", "heading": "Cost of administering the work", "source": "report", "rows": [{"icon": "contract", "label": "Financial advisory workplans", "value": "$1.6 million"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "Avoidable administration cost", "value": "$56,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.77, 0.9, 1.47, 1.89, 2.57, 3.01, 3.46, 3.6, 4.21]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Officials cited urgency. They could not recall why BART didn’t use emergency procurement.", "t0": 18.45, "t1": 24.21, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Emergency procurement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.61, 1.05, 2.19, 2.39, 2.55, 2.72, 3.18, 3.46, 3.79, 4.15, 4.37, 4.99]}, {"scene": "fix", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "BART agreed to guide staff on choosing the right procurement process.", "t0": 24.43, "t1": 28.26, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "BART Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Management response", "mark": "Management response"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.67, 0.78, 1.15, 1.6, 1.75, 2.15, 2.26, 2.49, 3.09]}, {"scene": "fix", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Inspector General still listed the recommendation as open in fiscal 2024.", "t0": 28.38, "t1": 33.45, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "annual24", "kicker": "BART Office of the Inspector General", "text": "FY2024 annual report", "mark": "FY2024 annual report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.65, 1.05, 1.33, 1.66, 1.77, 2.56, 2.8, 3.27, 3.46, 3.91, 4.27]}, {"scene": "fix", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The next annual report said BART had implemented procurement guidance.", "t0": 33.57, "t1": 37.37, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "annual25", "kicker": "BART Office of the Inspector General", "text": "FY2025 annual report", "mark": "FY2025 annual report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.44, 0.78, 1.22, 1.49, 1.82, 2.0, 2.58, 3.14]}, {"scene": "fix", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The record does not establish a cash recovery.", "t0": 37.49, "t1": 40.07, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Refund", "Final invoices"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.48, 0.69, 0.89, 1.44, 1.52, 1.9]}, {"scene": "fix", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.19, "t1": 42.8, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"contract": "How the work was ordered", "fix": "Procurement response"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "question"}